  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"17\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/tips_logo.gif\" width=\"200\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/memo_m.gif\" height=\"1188\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/alpha_background.gif\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"594\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;<b><img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/h.gif\" width=\"30\">YTHLOTH(히스로스)</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"290\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/image/dungeon/hyth_map.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"280\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:320/280\" width=\"320\"></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"300\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>던전설명 \n                                        :</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지도상에서는 \n                            눈섬과 히스로스섬은</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">극과극이지만 \n                            눈섬에서 북쪽으로 어느정도&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">올라가면 \n                            지도위치는 좌측하단 히스로스섬으로</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이동되는 \n                            것을 보실 수 있을 것입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">마을에서는 \n                            오클로나 서펜홀드에서</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">가까운 \n                            거리에 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">던전 \n                            지하3,4층은 좁은길목으로 인해</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">난이도가 \n                            상당히 높습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">-----------------------------------------------</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_1.gif\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_2.gif\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_3.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                                        : 던전이동지역</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(같은 모양의 아이콘끼리 \n                                        이동됩니다)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"9\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_4.gif\" width=\"13\"> \n                                        : 비밀문이나 잠김문</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_5.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                                        : 던전내 중요 지점</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(클릭 하시면 상세정보를 \n                                        보실 수 있습니다)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">----------------------------------------------</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" height=\"1082\" width=\"594\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"499\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"288\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/image/dungeon/hyth_1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"200\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:200/200\" width=\"200\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"211\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>지하1층</b></span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">입구에서부터 \n                                        다소 복잡한 미로형식의</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">던전 \n                                        형태를 보실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지하2층으로 \n                                        내려가는곳은 워프존으로</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">되어있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>주요 \n                                        몬스터 :</b></font></span><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020805094053/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/Lizard%20man.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>\n</b></font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020805094053/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/Imp.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Imp(임프)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020805094053/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/Hell%20Hound.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Hell \n                                        Hound(헬하운드)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Gargoyle/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Gargoyle(가고일)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020805094053/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/Fire%20Gargoyle.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Fire Gargoyle(파이어 가고일)</font></span></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/si